    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_09",
      "hash64": "372A532F0C71E632",
      "text": "With 2,000, you can afford to purchase a\\nmaximum of 10 Poké Balls...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_10",
      "hash64": "3727562F0C6FB574",
      "text": "However! If you purchase 10 or more of any one\\ntype of Poké Ball...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_11",
      "hash64": "3727572F0C6FB727",
      "text": "You will also receive one Premier Ball—a special\\nwhite ball—as a bonus![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_12",
      "hash64": "3727582F0C6FB8DA",
      "text": "So the correct answer is, in fact, 11![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_13",
      "hash64": "3727592F0C6FBA8D",
      "text": "It sure is nice to get a little bonus like that on a\\nshopping trip, isn’t it?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_02_math_14",
      "hash64": "3727522F0C6FAEA8",
      "text": "Oh, my. Is that the bell? I suppose that’s all for\\nnow. What a shame...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
